    "text": "fileFormatVersion: 2\nguid: 8925f8ef498b531b6b4c6192d5917c25\nMonoImporter:\n  externalObjects: {}\n  serializedVersion: 2\n  defaultReferences: []\n  executionOrder: 0\n  icon: {instanceID: 0}\n  userData: \n  assetBundleName: \n  assetBundleVariant: \n"
